ication form and download the confirmation page.</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"ui8njk\" data-start=\"351\" data-end=\"416\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Take a printout of the completed application form and fee receipt for future reference.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 75%; text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>UP Board Class 10th Result Toppers List 2026</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Student Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Percentage</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>District</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Aditi </span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">97.5%</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Barabanki</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Arpita</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">97.33%</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Sitapur</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Priti Verma</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">97.33%</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Bareilly</span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 25%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Kashish Verma</spa